flowchart TB
    S0(["Contributor opens /submission"]):::start --> P0
    P0["Step 1 - Prepare<br/>Read the checklist, open the template PDF<br/>Share the Google Doc: Anyone with the link, role Commenter<br/>Read the originality and AI-use guidelines"]:::blue
    P0 -->|"Start submission"| P1
    P1["Step 2 - Authors<br/>Your email for updates<br/>Up to 10 authors: name, institutional email, designation"]:::blue
    P1 --> V1{{"Valid?"}}:::amber
    V1 -->|"No"| E1["Error summary takes focus<br/>each message links to its field"]:::red --> P1
    V1 -->|"Yes, Continue"| P2
    P2["Step 3 - Research details<br/>Title (5+ characters)<br/>Description 20 to 250 words, live word count<br/>Keywords, comma separated<br/>Google Docs or Drive link"]:::blue
    P2 --> V2{{"Valid?<br/>link host is checked,<br/>lookalike hosts are refused"}}:::amber
    V2 -->|"No"| E2["Error summary + field errors"]:::red --> P2
    V2 -->|"Yes, Continue"| P3
    P3["Step 4 - Reports<br/>Similarity report PDF<br/>AI content detection report PDF<br/>each a PDF under 10 MB"]:::blue
    P3 --> V3{{"Both PDFs<br/>valid?"}}:::amber
    V3 -->|"No"| E3["Error summary + field errors"]:::red --> P3
    V3 -->|"Yes, Continue"| P4
    P4["Step 5 - Review and submit<br/>Summary with Change links back to any step<br/>Originality checkbox is required"]:::blue
    P4 -->|"Submit article"| UP["Upload with progress bar<br/>Reports uploading, then Saving your submission"]:::gold
    UP --> SV{{"Server checks everything again<br/>fields, link host, PDF signature, size"}}:::amber
    SV -->|"Field problem"| BACK["Sent back to the step that owns the field<br/>with the server message"]:::red --> P1
    SV -->|"Network or server failure"| FAIL["Your submission was not sent<br/>answers and chosen files are kept<br/>Try again"]:::red --> P4
    SV -->|"All good"| SAVE["Reports saved in the PRIVATE reports bucket<br/>Reference ITM-YYYY-XXXXXX created<br/>One-time access key created, only its hash is stored<br/>Article saved as SUBMITTED<br/>Audit event written<br/>Confirmation email queued"]:::green
    SAVE --> DONE["Confirmation page<br/>Reference + access key with Copy buttons<br/>What happens next<br/>Check status link"]:::green
    DRAFT["Draft text is kept in the browser tab session<br/>cleared after a successful submit<br/>files are never stored locally"]:::grey -.-> P1

